+      }
+
+      // A field that is currently store good was written during the old marking
+      // cycle that is ending right now - that is, before this page became
+      // permanent, so the store barrier never reported it, and any further store
+      // to it within the same colour epoch takes the store barrier fast path and
+      // will not report it either. Register its object now; that is the only
+      // thing that closes this window.
+      //
